	(text "Notes:\n- USB SSTX connects to SSRX on the other side\n- 0.1uF 0402 AC coupling caps should be placed near SSTX of the transmitting device.\n- Kiwi has internal AC coupling caps.\n- All data lines are 90 ohm differential pairs\n\nRESET_N and VBUS_DET should ideally rise after power supplies are ready."
